{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "collapsed": false
   },
   "source": [
    "## SCMeTA Data Process example pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "This is the example of SCMeTA Data Process pipeline.\n",
    "\n",
    "More details can be found in the [documentation](https://sc-meta.com)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "collapsed": true
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from SCMeTA import Process\n",
    "sc = Process(ref_mz=760.58)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Import Data\n",
    "# Path can be a file or a folder\n",
    "path = \"path to data\"\n",
    "# load data\n",
    "sc.load(path)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "load(): Add a file to the MSProcess\n",
    "\n",
    "Args:\n",
    "1. `path: str`\n",
    "2. `file_name: str | None = None`\n",
    "3. `data_type: str = \"thermo\"`: Data type, default`\"thermo\"` .raw file, can be `\"waters\"` .wiff file / `\"mzML\"` .mzML file / `\"process\"` .csv file.\n",
    "4. `method str = \"MultiThread\"`: Method to load, can be `\"MultiProcess\"`, `\"one by one\"`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Returns:\n",
    "1. `self.data: dict[file_name, SCData]`\n",
    "2. `self.__dir = os.path.dirname(path)`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Pre-process is necessary\n",
    "sc.pre_process()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "pre_process(): Pre-process the data, including peak_combine, offset, cut, and round.\n",
    "\n",
    "Args:\n",
    "1. `file_name: str | list[str] | None = None`\n",
    "2. `offset: float | None = None`\n",
    "3. `cut_range: tuple[int, int] | None = None`\n",
    "4. `resolution: float = PARAMETERS.resolution`=0.01\n",
    "5. `count: int = PARAMETERS.count`=10\n",
    "6. `offset_method: str = \"same\"`: Method to set offset, default `\"same\"`, can be `\"separatedly\"`.\n",
    "7. `cut_method: str = \"same\"`: Method to cut the data, default `\"same\"`, can be `\"separatedly\"`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Returns:\n",
    "1. `self.data.values().process: pd.Dataframe`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "collapsed": false
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Process Data\n",
    "sc.process()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "process():\n",
    "\n",
    "Args:\n",
    "1. `max_ratio: float = PARAMETERS.maxratio`=0.1: \n",
    "2. `adjacent: int = PARAMETERS.adjacent`=3:\n",
    "3. `snr: float = PARAMETERS.snr`=3.0:\n",
    "4. `resolution_intensity: float = PARAMETERS.resolution_intensity`=0.01:\n",
    "5. `threshold: float = PARAMETERS.threshold`=0.2:\n",
    "6. `lock_mz: bool = PARAMETERS.lock`=False:\n",
    "7. `filter_method: str = \"all\"`: default `\"all\"`, can be `\"any\"`\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "collapsed": false
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Post-Process Data\n",
    "data = sc.post_process()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "post_process():\n",
    "\n",
    "Args:\n",
    "1. `data: dict[str, SCData] = None`\n",
    "2. `normalize_method=None`=\"mz\": Method of normalization, default `\"mz\"`, can be `\"zscore\"` `\"max\"` `\"sum\"` `\"quantile\"` `\"log\"`\n",
    "3. `fillna_method: str = \"none\"`=\"knn\": Method of filling nan, default `\"knn\"`, can be `\"zero\"` `\"none\"`\n",
    "4. `tags: list[str] = None`: Tags of the data, abandoned\n",
    "\n",
    "Returns:\n",
    "`data: dict[str, SCData]`: Dict of MSData\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Optional\n",
    "# Save Data\n",
    "sc.save(data, path)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "save(): Save the MSProcess\n",
    "\n",
    "Args:\n",
    "1. `file_name: str | None = None`\n",
    "2. `data_type: str = \"cell_mat\"`: File type, default `\"cell_mat\"`, can be `\"mat\"`, `\"process\"`, `\"raw\"`\n",
    "3. `path: str | None = None`=path/Process\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "collapsed": false
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from SCMeTA import Plot"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Visualize Data\n",
    "path = \"path to data\"\n",
    "plot = Plot(path)\n",
    "plot.load(path=plot.path)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Plot(): Class to plot data\n",
    "\n",
    "Properties:\n",
    "\n",
    "`self.path: str |None = None`\n",
    "load(): load data for plot\n",
    "\n",
    "Args:\n",
    "1. `data: dict[str, SCData] | None = None`\n",
    "2. `path: str | None = None`\n",
    "3. `sort_key: str=\"alphabetical\"`: method to sort index, default `\"alphabetical\"`, can be `\"manual\"` or other sortkey in `sorted(key=lambda x: sortkey(x))`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plot.pca()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Args:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. `save: bool=False`: only auto save when `save is True`\n",
    "2. `save_path: str | None=None`=plot.path\n",
    "3. `dpi: int | None = None`=300"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plot.umap()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plot.tsne()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plot.heatmap()"
   ]
  }
 ],
